{"id":"1e5fb9d97fa0606e","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-supply.md","title":"Supply","display":"df-supply — Supply","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-supply","aliases":["58-df-supply"],"display":"df-supply — Supply","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-inner-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-supply"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-supply</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supply — Supply"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"58-df-inner-product\">58-df-inner-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_Y\\in V\">\\(S_Y\\in V\\)</span> (supply correspondence defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supply}\\vdash\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_Y,\\mathbb R^L,\\mathcal P(Y))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb R^L\\;\\left(S_Y(p)=\\{y\\in Y:\\forall z\\in Y\\;(p\\cdot z\\leq p\\cdot y)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supply}\\vdash\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_Y,\\mathbb R^L,\\mathcal P(Y))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb R^L\\;\\left(S_Y(p)=\\{y\\in Y:\\forall z\\in Y\\;(p\\cdot z\\leq p\\cdot y)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Supply is formalized as the set of feasible profit-maximizing quantities.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-inner-product","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-inner-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supply}\\vdash\\mathrm{SupplyCorrespondence}_S(S_Y;Y,L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land Y\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^L)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S_Y,\\mathbb R^L,\\mathcal P(Y))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb R^L\\;\\left(S_Y(p)=\\{y\\in Y:\\forall z\\in Y\\;(p\\cdot z\\leq p\\cdot y)\\}\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":955,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-supply.md|58-df-supply]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","ce5a656462edb0c9"]}